    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36198" root="قمر" body-key="q">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقمر الهِلَالُ</span></b>  <i>The new moon became what is
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَمَر</span>, <i>in the third night.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقمرت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْلَتُنَا</span> <i>Our night became bright</i> [<i>with light of the
moon</i>]. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْمَرْنَا</span> [<i>We entered upon the
time of moonlight;</i>] <i>the moon rose upon us.</i> (S,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقمر</span> <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>watched,</i> or
<i>waited, for the rising of the moon.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also 3.

